
Usage: /IN <channel> <command>
  Execute a <command> in a <channel> you are already in.  You can stay
  in  several  channels  at  once  by setting the environment variable
  CHANNELLINGER to Y and use /ENTER to enter the channels you want.


  Example:
     /IN hottub Don't let the water get cold!
     /IN zoo /ACTION tickle monkey

  See Also:
     /SETENV CHANNELLINGER

